YOUR OFFER DETAILS
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

  •  Program start: Monday, May 11, 2026
  •  Schedule: Monday to Wednesday in-person (10 AM to 4 PM)
  •  Thursday and Friday remote
  •  Duration: 10 weeks (through late July 2026)
  •  Cost to you: $0

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
WHAT YOU'LL GET
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

  •  Free professional training in HubSpot CRM, Revenue Operations, and AI tools

  •  Industry certifications (HubSpot, Google, Salesforce)

  •  Career coaching, employer connections, and a Demo Day presentation

  •  Wraparound support based on your individual needs. This may include transportation, meals, or emergency funds. A loaner laptop is available if you need one. Let us know when you confirm.

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
TO CONFIRM YOUR SEAT
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

Reply to program-rts@ulem.org with "I confirm" within 5 business days.

Seats are limited and held on a first-confirmed basis. If we don't hear from you by then, we may offer your seat to someone on the waitlist.

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
BEFORE OR ON ORIENTATION (MAY 11)
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

Please submit the following documents. You can bring physical copies to orientation, or send them by email to program-rts@ulem.org any time before May 11.

  •  Copy of your diploma, GED, or college transcripts
  •  Copy of your Social Security card
  •  Copy of your ID or driver's license
  •  Signed Student Handbook (attached)
  •  Completed and signed Partial Intake Form (attached)

